  "statement": "The EfficiencyAgent emphasizes the critical need for performance efficiency in the ATM system. EFF-01 ensures transactions are processed within 3 seconds, enhancing user responsiveness. EFF-02 mandates a throughput of at least 100 transactions per minute, crucial for high-demand environments. EFF-03 focuses on optimizing data retrieval to minimize latency, improving user experience. EFF-04 prevents negative balances, aligning with operational efficiency. EFF-05 ensures automatic fund withdrawals without user delay, streamlining transactions. EFF-06 provides immediate feedback on insufficient funds, enhancing user awareness. EFF-07 implements load balancing to manage requests effectively, ensuring system reliability under load.",
